<mxCell id="c119" value="&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt; Developer pushes code or a catalog PR to GitHub&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt; CI builds the image/chart and pushes it to Artifact Registry&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt; CI runs Terraform using Workload Identity (no keys)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1095" width="500" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c120" value="&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt; Terraform creates the customer folders, projects, runtimes, LB, data&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt; Runtimes pull images from Artifact Registry&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt; Ansible runners configure the MIG VMs" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="1095" width="500" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c121" value="&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt; End users hit the customer env through HTTPS LB + Cloud Armor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt; LB routes by hostname to the product's runtime (Cloud Run, GKE or MIG)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt; Services use the customer's data project (own envs only)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="1095" width="490" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
